TITLE 1D transport with exchange; get exch 1 CaX2 equiv frac at step 6 from output
SOLUTION 0  Influent
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
PRINT
    -exchange true
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
END
